    <string name="remote_title">Use this phone as a remote camera</string>
    <string name="remote_body">Put your phone where it can see you and control your computer with gestures. Only the name of each gesture is sent over your Wi-Fi — never video.</string>
    <string name="remote_steps">On the computer: Imaa → Settings → Integrations → turn on “Use my phone as a remote camera”, then scan the QR code with this phone’s camera, or type the details below.</string>
