    <string name="accessibility_label">Imaa gesture control</string>
    <string name="accessibility_summary">Hands-free control with hand and head gestures.</string>
    <string name="accessibility_description">Imaa lets you control your phone without touching it, using hand and head gestures seen by the front camera. It performs taps, swipes, pinches and system actions (Back, Home, Recents, Notifications, Screenshot) that you request with gestures, and presses visible “Skip ad” buttons when you make the skip gesture. Imaa does not collect, store or share screen content or personal data.</string>

